    {
      "id": "s38",
      "start": 464.7,
      "end": 469.73333333333335,
      "kind": "end",
      "title": "AARON GUO",
      "sub": "AI-NATIVE BUILDER \u00b7 Human-first thinker",
      "nodes": [],
      "media": null,
      "facts": [],
      "sources": [],
      "rail": "",
      "tension": false,
      "cues": [
        0.5124473333332844
      ],
      "detailCue": 1.0124473333332844
    }
  ],
  "captions": [
    {
      "start": 3.058,
      "end": 3.848,
      "text": "Years ago,"
    },
    {
      "start": 3.9290000000000003,
      "end": 5.531000000000001,
      "text": "while working at Amazon,"
    },
    {
      "start": 6.111000000000001,
      "end": 8.155000000000001,
      "text": "I had already reached a conclusion."
    },
    {
      "start": 9.397,
      "end": 12.509,
      "text": "A company can afford a lot of desirable jobs"
    },
    {
      "start": 12.938,
      "end": 15.585,
      "text": "without needing a team of that size to create"
    },
    {
      "start": 15.643,
      "end": 16.862000000000002,
      "text": "its business value."
    },
    {
      "start": 18.105,
      "end": 19.974,
      "text": "That judgment stayed with me."
    },
    {
      "start": 20.577,
      "end": 23.213,
      "text": "And as AI takes on more implementation,"
    },
    {
      "start": 23.782,
      "end": 27.486,
      "text": "I think engineers should pay closer attention to where"
    },
    {
      "start": 27.521,
      "end": 29.216,
      "text": "their work becomes useful."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.237,
      "end": 33.349000000000004,
      "text": "Organizations can grow around management layers,"
    },
    {
      "start": 33.697,
      "end": 35.114,
      "text": "departmental interests,"
    },
    {
      "start": 35.415,
      "end": 37.018,
      "text": "and internal politics."
    },
    {
      "start": 37.888,
      "end": 39.642,
      "text": "Coordination expands."
    },
    {
      "start": 40.513,
      "end": 42.951,
      "text": "The customer's problem may barely change."
    },
    {
      "start": 43.763,
      "end": 47.188,
      "text": "Someone can work very hard while their abilities are"
    },
    {
      "start": 47.246,
      "end": 51.205,
      "text": "absorbed by work the organization created for itself."
    },
    {
      "start": 52.32,
      "end": 57.312,
      "text": "So Amazon's later restructuring and layoffs didn't surprise me."
    },
    {
      "start": 58.49525,
      "end": 60.06325,
      "text": "In twenty twenty-four,"
    },
    {
      "start": 60.63225,
      "end": 65.78725,
      "text": "Amazon announced plans to reduce layers and unnecessary processes."
    },
    {
      "start": 66.55324999999999,
      "end": 67.62125,
      "text": "The following year,"
    },
    {
      "start": 67.78325,
      "end": 71.78925,
      "text": "Andy Jassy said he expected AI efficiency to reduce"
    },
    {
      "start": 71.83525,
      "end": 74.80725,
      "text": "its total corporate workforce over time."
    },
    {
      "start": 75.57425,
      "end": 80.54325,
      "text": "Its January twenty twenty-six layoff announcement again emphasized fewer"
    },
    {
      "start": 80.65925,
      "end": 83.32925,
      "text": "layers and less bureaucracy."
    },
    {
      "start": 84.14225,
      "end": 87.33425,
      "text": "Those statements describe an organization changing."
    },
    {
      "start": 88.03125,
      "end": 91.51425,
      "text": "They cannot tell us what any individual contributed."
    },
    {
      "start": 92.26925,
      "end": 97.43525,
      "text": "My interpretation is that cheaper execution accelerates a reassessment"
    },
    {
      "start": 97.48225,
      "end": 99.22325000000001,
      "text": "that was already needed."
    },
    {
      "start": 99.60624999999999,
      "end": 101.82425,
      "text": "For the next five to ten years,"
    },
    {
      "start": 102.14925,
      "end": 105.45824999999999,
      "text": "I want to invest more in understanding customers,"
    },
    {
      "start": 105.84125,
      "end": 107.57124999999999,
      "text": "making product decisions,"
    },
    {
      "start": 107.95425,
      "end": 110.93825,
      "text": "and carrying worthwhile work into use."
    },
    {
      "start": 111.32124999999999,
      "end": 116.19725,
      "text": "Stronger implementation tools give engineers room to take on"
    },
    {
      "start": 116.31325,
      "end": 118.43825,
      "text": "more of that responsibility."
    },
    {
      "start": 119.44785416666666,
      "end": 123.13985416666667,
      "text": "Boris Cherny has described having Claude Code write his"
    },
    {
      "start": 123.23285416666667,
      "end": 125.70585416666667,
      "text": "code while he continues reviewing it."
    },
    {
      "start": 126.65785416666667,
      "end": 130.50085416666667,
      "text": "Simon Willison describes quickly trying several prototypes."
    },
    {
      "start": 130.94185416666664,
      "end": 134.15785416666665,
      "text": "These are particular practitioners' experiences."
    },
    {
      "start": 134.96985416666666,
      "end": 137.93085416666668,
      "text": "What interests me is how they change our allocation"
    },
    {
      "start": 137.98885416666667,
      "end": 138.67385416666667,
      "text": "of time."
    },
    {
      "start": 139.84685416666667,
      "end": 142.16885416666668,
      "text": "Once you can try an idea more cheaply,"
    },
    {
      "start": 142.71385416666666,
      "end": 146.10385416666665,
      "text": "deciding which idea deserves the effort becomes more valuable."
    },
    {
      "start": 147.92685416666666,
      "end": 150.96885416666666,
      "text": "The first place I'd invest is a business domain."
    },
    {
      "start": 151.51385416666665,
      "end": 153.33685416666665,
      "text": "Learn who uses a product,"
    },
    {
      "start": 153.51085416666666,
      "end": 154.49785416666666,
      "text": "who pays,"
    },
    {
      "start": 154.70685416666666,
      "end": 157.91185416666667,
      "text": "and who bears the consequences when it fails."
    },
    {
      "start": 158.72385416666665,
      "end": 162.67185416666666,
      "text": "Kent Beck used payroll to illustrate how much responsibility"
    },
    {
      "start": 162.74085416666668,
      "end": 165.95685416666666,
      "text": "sits behind apparently simple functionality."
    },
    {
      "start": 166.76985416666668,
      "end": 169.96285416666666,
      "text": "Calculating an amount is only part of the work."
    },
    {
      "start": 170.77485416666667,
      "end": 174.38585416666666,
      "text": "Keep learning those obligations through actual projects."
    },
    {
      "start": 175.50085416666667,
      "end": 176.38285416666668,
      "text": "Over time,"
    },
    {
      "start": 176.76585416666666,
      "end": 180.73685416666666,
      "text": "you'll notice needs that haven't reached a requirements document."
    },
    {
      "start": 181.57345833333332,
      "end": 183.58145833333333,
      "text": "Then get closer to customers."
    },
    {
      "start": 184.61445833333332,
      "end": 187.90045833333332,
      "text": "Imagine a tool that processes business documents."
    },
    {
      "start": 188.31845833333333,
      "end": 190.29245833333331,
      "text": "This is a hypothetical example."
    },
    {
      "start": 190.86145833333333,
      "end": 194.0534583333333,
      "text": "The demonstration extracts every field beautifully."
    },
    {
      "start": 195.2614583333333,
      "end": 197.0954583333333,
      "text": "But when you watch someone work,"
    },
    {
      "start": 197.17645833333333,
      "end": 199.12745833333332,
      "text": "you discover where they pause:"
    },
    {
      "start": 200.33445833333332,
      "end": 201.7974583333333,
      "text": "an unusual document,"
    },
    {
      "start": 202.2734583333333,
      "end": 203.73645833333333,
      "text": "a missing confirmation,"
    },
    {
      "start": 204.30545833333332,
      "end": 206.08145833333333,
      "text": "a result they don't trust."
    },
    {
      "start": 206.7204583333333,
      "end": 208.93745833333332,
      "text": "That pause can tell you more about the next"
    },
    {
      "start": 209.0534583333333,
      "end": 212.71045833333332,
      "text": "feature than another hour polishing the demo."
    },
    {
      "start": 213.92945833333332,
      "end": 216.1714583333333,
      "text": "Ask the person to show you how they handle"
    },
    {
      "start": 216.20545833333333,
      "end": 217.3204583333333,
      "text": "that case today."
    },
    {
      "start": 218.12145833333332,
      "end": 219.1434583333333,
      "text": "Who checks it?"
    },
    {
      "start": 219.6424583333333,
      "end": 221.52345833333334,
      "text": "How do they correct a mistake?"
    },
    {
      "start": 222.61445833333332,
      "end": 225.64445833333332,
      "text": "What must continue working in their existing system?"
    },
    {
      "start": 226.56145833333332,
      "end": 230.6834583333333,
      "text": "You may discover that exception handling deserves attention first."
    },
    {
      "start": 231.76345833333332,
      "end": 234.46845833333333,
      "text": "Use some of the time AI saves to have"
    },
    {
      "start": 234.49145833333333,
      "end": 235.64145833333333,
      "text": "that conversation,"
    },
    {
      "start": 236.33745833333333,
      "end": 239.5304583333333,
      "text": "and come back after delivery to see what changed."
    },
    {
      "start": 240.53045833333334,
      "end": 243.28145833333335,
      "text": "The third investment is product judgment."
    },
    {
      "start": 244.03645833333334,
      "end": 247.76345833333335,
      "text": "Willison says he often tries three design approaches."
    },
    {
      "start": 248.65745833333335,
      "end": 252.10545833333333,
      "text": "He also advocates watching real people use the software."
    },
    {
      "start": 252.85945833333335,
      "end": 255.16945833333335,
      "text": "For our imagined document tool,"
    },
    {
      "start": 255.43645833333335,
      "end": 256.91145833333337,
      "text": "compare two approaches:"
    },
    {
      "start": 257.3294583333334,
      "end": 258.79245833333334,
      "text": "verify every item,"
    },
    {
      "start": 259.00145833333335,
      "end": 261.42745833333333,
      "text": "or highlight only the exceptions."
    },
    {
      "start": 262.2404583333333,
      "end": 264.30645833333335,
      "text": "Build enough to answer the question."
    },
    {
      "start": 265.00345833333336,
      "end": 267.8824583333333,
      "text": "Then watch where a user hesitates and whether they"
    },
    {
      "start": 267.92945833333334,
      "end": 270.0074583333333,
      "text": "can finish the original task."
    },
    {
      "start": 271.0074583333333,
      "end": 271.9714583333333,
      "text": "Before building,"
    },
    {
      "start": 272.14545833333335,
      "end": 274.5144583333333,
      "text": "write down what you need to learn."
    },
    {
      "start": 275.3274583333333,
      "end": 276.24445833333334,
      "text": "Afterward,"
    },
    {
      "start": 276.73145833333336,
      "end": 279.0194583333333,
      "text": "ask whether the attempt answered it."
    },
    {
      "start": 280.08745833333336,
      "end": 282.6994583333333,
      "text": "This is how product judgment develops:"
    },
    {
      "start": 283.26845833333334,
      "end": 284.68445833333334,
      "text": "choosing what belongs,"
    },
    {
      "start": 284.8824583333333,
      "end": 285.8684583333333,
      "text": "what can wait,"
    },
    {
      "start": 286.18245833333333,
      "end": 289.5144583333333,
      "text": "and which complexity the business actually requires."
    },
    {
      "start": 290.28045833333334,
      "end": 292.5094583333333,
      "text": "AI can propose alternatives."
    },
    {
      "start": 292.9974583333333,
      "end": 295.69145833333334,
      "text": "Your contact with the work gives you a basis"
    },
    {
      "start": 295.76045833333336,
      "end": 297.15345833333333,
      "text": "for choosing among them."
    },
    {
      "start": 297.93122916666664,
      "end": 300.59022916666663,
      "text": "The fourth investment is commercial judgment."
    },
    {
      "start": 301.48422916666664,
      "end": 304.77022916666664,
      "text": "A useful product still asks someone to change."
    },
    {
      "start": 305.4202291666667,
      "end": 306.7902291666666,
      "text": "Money is one cost."
    },
    {
      "start": 307.13822916666663,
      "end": 307.90422916666665,
      "text": "Migration,"
    },
    {
      "start": 308.17122916666665,
      "end": 308.74022916666667,
      "text": "learning,"
    },
    {
      "start": 308.93822916666664,
      "end": 309.7852291666666,
      "text": "integration,"
    },
    {
      "start": 310.19222916666666,
      "end": 311.80522916666666,
      "text": "and trust matter too."
    },
    {
      "start": 312.68822916666664,
      "end": 316.58922916666666,
      "text": "Understand why the customer's existing approach has survived."
    },
    {
      "start": 317.54122916666665,
      "end": 321.2562291666666,
      "text": "Then test whether your improvement is worth that disruption."
    },
    {
      "start": 322.31322916666664,
      "end": 325.7612291666666,
      "text": "A working prototype gives you something concrete to discuss"
    },
    {
      "start": 325.85422916666664,
      "end": 327.61822916666665,
      "text": "with a potential customer."
    },
    {
      "start": 328.57022916666665,
      "end": 330.6482291666666,
      "text": "Would they spend time trying it?"
    },
    {
      "start": 331.46122916666667,
      "end": 333.40022916666663,
      "text": "Would they discuss an integration?"
    },
    {
      "start": 334.63022916666665,
      "end": 336.0352291666666,
      "text": "Who controls the budget,"
    },
    {
      "start": 336.07022916666665,
      "end": 338.49622916666664,
      "text": "and where do they look for alternatives?"
    },
    {
      "start": 338.91422916666664,
      "end": 340.40022916666663,
      "text": "Include model usage,"
    },
    {
      "start": 340.66722916666663,
      "end": 341.50322916666664,
      "text": "maintenance,"
    },
    {
      "start": 341.66622916666665,
      "end": 343.44222916666666,
      "text": "and support in your estimate."
    },
    {
      "start": 344.34822916666667,
      "end": 349.47922916666664,
      "text": "Cheaper development gives some previously expensive ideas another chance."
    },
    {
      "start": 349.89722916666665,
      "end": 353.07822916666663,
      "text": "Contact with the market tells you which ones deserve"
    },
    {
      "start": 353.11322916666666,
      "end": 353.91422916666664,
      "text": "to continue."
    },
    {
      "start": 355.01422916666667,
      "end": 355.69922916666667,
      "text": "Finally,"
    },
    {
      "start": 356.10622916666665,
      "end": 358.55522916666666,
      "text": "take a project through a complete cycle."
    },
    {
      "start": 359.57722916666665,
      "end": 364.70922916666666,
      "text": "Microsoft Digital reported that faster individual development initially failed"
    },
    {
      "start": 364.8022291666667,
      "end": 366.8572291666667,
      "text": "to improve team productivity."
    },
    {
      "start": 367.8782291666667,
      "end": 372.41822916666666,
      "text": "It later brought business intent and acceptance criteria into"
    },
    {
      "start": 372.52222916666665,
      "end": 374.2292291666667,
      "text": "a shared specification."
    },
    {
      "start": 375.0882291666667,
      "end": 377.2012291666667,
      "text": "That's an organizational account,"
    },
    {
      "start": 377.66622916666665,
      "end": 379.87222916666667,
      "text": "but it highlights something practical:"
    },
    {
      "start": 380.7422291666667,
      "end": 383.59822916666667,
      "text": "progress depends on the connections across the work."
    },
    {
      "start": 384.3072291666667,
      "end": 385.52622916666667,
      "text": "Agree on the goal."
    },
    {
      "start": 386.1532291666667,
      "end": 387.5452291666667,
      "text": "Connect the systems."
    },
    {
      "start": 388.01022916666665,
      "end": 389.7052291666667,
      "text": "Check real failure cases."
    },
    {
      "start": 390.3432291666667,
      "end": 391.8642291666667,
      "text": "Help the user get started,"
    },
    {
      "start": 391.89922916666666,
      "end": 393.95422916666666,
      "text": "and return to learn what happened."
    },
    {
      "start": 394.97622916666666,
      "end": 398.5752291666667,
      "text": "I recently used AI on a reporting task across"
    },
    {
      "start": 398.66822916666666,
      "end": 401.6982291666667,
      "text": "several systems and verified it in development."
    },
    {
      "start": 402.4532291666667,
      "end": 404.84422916666665,
      "text": "It made me more willing to take on complete"
    },
    {
      "start": 404.9022291666667,
      "end": 405.6332291666667,
      "text": "tasks."
    },
    {
      "start": 406.6672291666667,
      "end": 410.3592291666667,
      "text": "Engineering experience helps make the result something others can"
    },
    {
      "start": 410.4172291666667,
      "end": 410.98622916666665,
      "text": "trust."
    },
    {
      "start": 411.7968125,
      "end": 414.9968125,
      "text": "The judgment I reached at Amazon still matters to"
    },
    {
      "start": 415.0968125,
      "end": 415.2178125,
      "text": "me."
    },
    {
      "start": 416.67781249999996,
      "end": 419.0968125,
      "text": "A role can be provided by an organization."
    },
    {
      "start": 420.47781249999997,
      "end": 423.8568125,
      "text": "My abilities need an ongoing connection to real needs."
    },
    {
      "start": 425.3068125,
      "end": 428.26681249999996,
      "text": "Each project is a chance to strengthen that connection:"
    },
    {
      "start": 429.52681249999995,
      "end": 431.3668125,
      "text": "understand a customer more deeply,"
    },
    {
      "start": 432.1668125,
      "end": 433.72781249999997,
      "text": "make a better product choice,"
    },
    {
      "start": 434.3668125,
      "end": 436.94681249999996,
      "text": "and learn what it takes for someone to adopt"
    },
    {
      "start": 437.00681249999997,
      "end": 437.6868125,
      "text": "the result."
    },
    {
      "start": 438.98781249999996,
      "end": 441.5468125,
      "text": "If AI can handle much more work in five"
    },
    {
      "start": 441.6068125,
      "end": 442.44681249999996,
      "text": "or ten years,"
    },
    {
      "start": 443.06781249999995,
      "end": 445.8668125,
      "text": "I want to understand more about what people need"
    },
    {
      "start": 445.92781249999996,
      "end": 446.44681249999996,
      "text": "by then."
    },
    {
      "start": 447.32681249999996,
      "end": 450.28681249999994,
      "text": "That growth can begin with the next conversation and"
    },
    {
      "start": 450.3468125,
      "end": 451.46681249999995,
      "text": "the next project."
    },
    {
      "start": 452.8068125,
      "end": 456.78681249999994,
      "text": "Stronger tools make me optimistic about what engineers can"
    },
    {
      "start": 456.8668125,
      "end": 457.38681249999996,
      "text": "attempt."
    },
    {
      "start": 458.70681249999996,
      "end": 461.0678125,
      "text": "I want to use that opportunity to make things"
    },
    {
      "start": 461.1668125,
      "end": 464.4268125,
      "text": "I care about that someone else actually needs."
    }
  ]
}